			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος ἀ.</span> a war <i>begun without
				formal declaration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.16.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>uninvited,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φοιτᾶν ἐπὶ δεῖπνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					44
				</span></i>
			.</div>
